MNGL provides the CMake package `MNGL` and target `MNGL::MNGL`.

    find_package(MNGL CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE MNGL::MNGL)

The default `audio` feature enables the MNGL audio facade and adds SDL3_mixer.
Disable default features in your manifest to omit audio:

    {
      "dependencies": [
        {
          "name": "mngl",
          "default-features": false
        }
      ]
    }

MNGL is experimental and its API may change between versions.